---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import styles from "./index.module.css";
---

<Layout title="Omnyist Productions">
  <main class={styles.main}>
    <div class={styles.content}>
      <h1 class={styles.title}>
        We build things for ourselves <span class={styles.subtitle}
          >(and hope you find them useful too)</span
        >
      </h1>
      <p>
        We are a small collective of four omni-hobbyists: Bryan, Dave, Dan, and
        Scott, who enjoy building software for an audience of one: ourselves.
        We're veterans of the Internet, having seen how design and development
        have evolved over the past 25 years: from Web Standards to... whatever
        you call the current age.
      </p>
      <p>
        The software we make may seem all over the place when it comes to the
        needs we cover, but we will always believe that building great software
        starts with fulfilling your own needs first.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
